+| `AuditPareto.integral_posPart_paretoMeasure` | theorem | `∫ max (x−m) 0 dν = (L/m)^α · m/(α−1)`. |
+| `AuditPareto.paretoMAD L α` | def | `2L(α−1)^{α−2}/α^{α−1}`. |
+| `AuditPareto.abs_eq_two_mul_max_sub`, `paretoMAD_algebra`, `integral_abs_sub_mean_paretoMeasure`, `paretoMAD_pos` | theorems | `|t| = 2 max t 0 − t`; the exponent algebra; **`∫ |x − m| dν = paretoMAD L α`** for `α > 1`; positivity. |
+| `AuditPareto.integrable_sq_paretoMeasure`, `memLp_two_id_paretoMeasure`, `integral_sq_paretoMeasure` | theorems | `x²` integrable, `MemLp id 2 ν`, `∫ x² = αL²/(α−2)` for `α > 2`. |
